      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETAPIOCA SOUP.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n156. INGREDIENTS: 5 oz. of tapioca, 2 quarts of stock No. 105 or 106.\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Ci\u003EMode\u003C/i\u003E: Put the tapioca into cold stock, and bring it gradually to a boil. Simmer gently till tender, and serve.\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Ci\u003ETime\u003C/i\u003E: Rather more than 1 hour. Average cost. 1s. or 6d. per quart.\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Ci\u003ESeasonable\u003C/i\u003E: all the year.\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Ci\u003ESufficient\u003C/i\u003E: for 8 persons.\u003Cbr\u003E"
